  "description": "*Promotional Manhwa for the webnovel.* \n\nI came into the world of a novel I was reading, and became an unknown extra destined for a miserable life. Teaching manners to a crazy bastard who turns into a tyrant? \n\nManners, my ass! \n\nQuick thinking was my only means of survival. I tried everything to prevent such a tragic relationship with the tyrant from happening. I kicked, punched and screamed his head off, but I was still beaten in the end. Actually, he’s unexpectedly docile at times and even told me, \n\n“You’re the first person who understands me.” \n\nThe male lead’s personality is strange.",
